// # Unified Multimedia Codecs, DSP & Audio Synthesis Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 image, audio, video codec, digital signal processing, and sound synthesis submodules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API importing all companion submodules in media_dsp.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular Image Codecs, Audio Codecs, Video/Color Processors, DSP Filters, and Sound Synthesis submodules.
//   2. Re-export public configurations, audio engine pipelines, and codec factory constructors.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA multimedia applications.

